<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico places four credits in money mkt.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico places four credits in money mkt.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico completed all four credit auctions totalling 4.804 billion pesos on the secondary market on Thursday.</p>
<p>The auction results were as follows:</p>
<p>   CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM     MAX    MIN    AVERAGE</p>
<p>1.268 bln pesos  15 days  25.67  25.38  25.58</p>
<p>1.268 bln pesos  13 days  25.42  25.36  25.40</p>
<p>1.268 bln pesos  12 days  25.39  25.03  25.24</p>
<p>   1.000 bln pesos   1 day   24.38  24.38  24.38</p>
<p>The minimum, maximum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom (525) 728-9559</p>
</text>
